# Team AI rules (@twoj-zespol/ai-toolkit)

Starter rules shipped as `rules/CLAUDE.md` in the team toolkit package. The
installer copies this file into the consumer's `CLAUDE.md` between the package
sentinel markers. Do not put the markers in this file, and do not edit the
installed block by hand: change this file, bump the package version and publish.

## Skills from this package

| When | Use |
|---|---|
| Reviewing a diff or a PR before merge | `/code-review` |

## Working rules

- Follow the team conventions encoded in `/code-review`; when a rule there
  conflicts with this repository's own `CLAUDE.md`, the repository wins.
- Never commit secrets, tokens or `.npmrc` entries with `_authToken`.
- Keep changes small and reviewable; run the project's tests before proposing a
  commit.
- When a team rule looks wrong for this repository, say so and propose a change
  to the toolkit instead of silently ignoring it.
